{"meta":{"id":"tt0110413","type":"movie","name":"El Perfecto Asesino","imdb_id":"tt0110413","description":"Stan es un corrupto agente de la DEA cuya codicia le lleva a cometer asesinatos en las calles de Nueva York. El mortal juego del gato y el ratón empieza cuando se cruza en su camino un solitario hombre, llamado León. León es asesino a sueldo, un personaje indestructible e indocumentado, que sólo bebe leche y se ocupa de su planta. En medio se encuentra una huerfana de 12 años, que no puede olvidar al hombre que asesinó a su familia. Ella acabará convirtiéndose en algo importante para León y tal vez en su perdición.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0110413.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fj0hwDJEOOHllRim2BMt5L7tbjf.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Z3rG8rBnEpX2vlYMjV9GKgWtvv.png","genres":["Crimen","Drama","Acción"],"releaseInfo":"1994","released":"1994-09-14T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"110 min","imdbRating":"8.5","country":"France","cast":["Jean Reno","Natalie Portman","Gary Oldman","Danny Aiello","Peter Appel","Michael Badalucco","Ellen Greene","Frank Senger","Elizabeth Regen","Carl J. Matusovich","Eric Challier","Willi One Blood","Don Creech","Keith A. Glascoe","Jernard Burks","Matt De Matt","Stuart Rudin","Lucius Wyatt Cherokee","Maïwenn","Luc Bernard","Joseph Malerba","Adam Busch","Jessie Keosian","George Martin","Alex Dezen","Michael Mundra","Kent Broadhurst","Tommy Hollis","Peter Linari","Betty Miller"],"director":["Luc Besson"],"writer":["Luc Besson"],"trailers":[{"source":"AjGr4tjEa5M","type":"Trailer","name":"Leon (The Professional) - Trailer [ El Perfecto Asesino ]","ytId":"AjGr4tjEa5M","lang":"es"},{"source":"DD-6bmOY__g","type":"Trailer","name":"30 Year Anniversary 4K Restoration - Official Trailer","ytId":"DD-6bmOY__g","lang":"en"},{"source":"Nq101UyQyTo","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"Nq101UyQyTo","lang":"en"},{"source":